## 20. Testing / verification
No tests are present.

For this query, testing would mean validating against a known schema with cases such as:
- matching/nonmatching table names;
- matching/nonmatching column names;
- duplicate column names across schemas;
- views vs tables;
- wildcard characters in search terms.

Because the task is read-only metadata discovery, failure risk is lower than for DDL/DML, but correctness still matters.

